usage: run.py [-h] --python PYTHON --executable EXECUTABLE --docker DOCKER
              --output OUTPUT --source-commit SOURCE_COMMIT --native-source
              NATIVE_SOURCE

Run the reviewed public MCP acceptance after separate native runtime
authorization.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --python PYTHON       Installed interpreter used by the shipped launcher.
  --executable EXECUTABLE
                        Exact approved ResInsight executable.
  --docker DOCKER       Absolute approved Docker executable.
  --output OUTPUT       Unused absolute evidence directory outside the
                        repository.
  --source-commit SOURCE_COMMIT
                        Full application source commit used to build the
                        installed wheel.
  --native-source NATIVE_SOURCE
                        Native source checkout for exact build provenance.
